{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17608","headline":"郡中翫月寄江南李少尹虞部孟员外三首 二 · 羊士谔","name":"郡中翫月寄江南李少尹虞部孟员外三首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"桂华临洛浦，如挹李膺仙。\n兹夕披云望，还吟掷地篇。\n凤池分直夜，牛渚泛舟年。\n会是风流赏，惟君内史贤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"羊士谔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17608.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17608","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}